{
  "app": "pegroom",
  "note": "Answer key for bench/heldout/pegroom, a held-out benchmark app: never read by the people or agents who tune nunchi (see bench/heldout/README.md). Kept outside the app folder so a hunter pointed at the app never reads it. 'rule' names the rule or computed lens expected to catch the defect; defects with rule null are for the AI lenses. 'ai': how bench/ai-gate.mjs matches a claim to the seed — same lens and route, a state in 'states' when given, a viewport in 'viewports' when given, and either a checklist id in 'rules' or one of 'match' in the claim, selector or source (case-insensitive).",
  "clean": [
    "/about",
    "/help",
    "/history"
  ],
